  "id": "20260919-v3-stage-cp09-docs-analysis",
  "title": "V3 stage-oriented refactor CP09 — commands, read-only docs, and analysis lifecycle",
  "goal": "Complete Plan 06 P8 by making commands/ the stable public surface, removing Markdown Import, generating source-bound read-only aggregate documentation, and separating runtime analysis from reviewed evidence and snapshots.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "Public V3 and IFX entry points live under commands/ while legacy public paths are thin deprecation wrappers with unchanged arguments and exit codes.",
    "docs-map.json is schema-validated and deterministically renders OVERVIEW.md, COMMANDS.md, POST.md, CI.md plus read-only profile views with source roles and a composite SHA-256; Check rejects source or output drift and Import is unavailable.",
    "Authored architecture material is under docs/authored; reviewed analysis inputs and frozen reports are under stages/analysis, update only through maintenance Preview/Apply, and Analyze/Review runtime output stays under artifacts/guards/<package>/analysis/.",
    "Manifest ownership, trusted-base candidate parity, package tests, Docs Check, Validate, and protected-change Diff all pass with no runtime writes under docs/guards."
  ],
